downloader/*.egg-info/
.Python
# Anchored to the repo root on purpose. Unanchored, `env/` matches a directory
# called `env` at ANY depth — which silently excluded the whole of `src/env/`
# (toolchain detection, installers, diagnostics, subprocess handling) from the
# repository. A fresh clone got a tree that could not import its own agent.
/env/
/ENV/
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.tox/
.nox/
htmlcov/
*.cover
.hypothesis/

# Logs & temp
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# OS junk
